"(frontal/traseiro). **Inverter** em equirect equivale a yaw +180 e não "
"espelha."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/effects.rst:1635
msgid ""
"**Create a fisheye output:** Choose one of the **Fisheye** projection modes "
"(2..5). **Out FOV** controls disk coverage (180 gives a classic circular "
"fisheye)."
msgstr ""
"**Crie uma saída fisheye:** Escolha um dos modos de projeção **Fisheye** "
"(2..5). **FOV de Saída** controla a cobertura do disco (180 gera um fisheye "
"circular clássico)."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/effects.rst:1637
msgid ""
"If the image looks mirrored, turn **Invert** off. If you need the back view "
"on equirect, use **Invert** or add +180 to **Yaw**."
msgstr ""
